{"title": "Heart of Ice", "pageid": 28087, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Heart_of_Ice", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Heart of Ice</b> is a passive feature that lets the wielder deal extra cold damage when dealing cold damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage, the wielder deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">1</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mourning_Frost\" title=\"Mourning Frost\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mourning_Frost\" title=\"Mourning Frost\">Mourning Frost</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The in-game description also says \"A Frostbitten creature that takes Cold damage will take an additional 1 Cold damage per turn of Frostbite remaining.\" However, it has no interaction or relation with the inaccessible <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frostbite_(Condition)\" title=\"Frostbite (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Frostbite_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Frostbite_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Frostbite_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frostbite_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Frostbite_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Frostbite_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frostbite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Frostbite_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Frostbite_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Frostbite_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frostbite_(Condition)\" title=\"Frostbite (Condition)\">Frostbite</a> condition.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202812\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1628/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13490/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4827/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 937188/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.423      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   45.423      1 -total\n 29.57%   13.430      3 Template:Icon_link\n 29.17%   13.252      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 28.44%   12.918      3 Template:Icon_text\n 27.36%   12.427     20 Template:Trim\n 22.82%   10.364      1 Template:DamageType\n 19.95%    9.062      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 18.89%    8.580      5 Template:Ifempty\n 17.91%    8.137      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg